TripoSG for Snapdragon 8 Elite (QNN, on-device)

This model set is a conversion of TripoSG (https://github.com/VAST-AI-Research/TripoSG,
commit fc5c40990181e2a756c4e0b1c2f4d6b5202faf8c; weights VAST-AI/TripoSG revision
2c1c516d22d58db486a058d98d31bb6177344e06), MIT License, Copyright (c) 2025
VAST-AI-Research and contributors. The weights were exported to ONNX and the
transformer and VAE decoder were compiled with Qualcomm AI Hub into QNN context binaries.

u2net.onnx: U-2-Net (https://github.com/xuebinqin/U-2-Net) by Xuebin Qin et al.,
Apache License 2.0 (see LICENSE-u2net). The file is the unmodified u2net.onnx from
the rembg release (https://github.com/danielgatis/rembg), SHA-256
8d10d2f3bb75ae3b6d527c77944fc5e7dcd94b29809d47a739a7a728a912b491.

